;;;;
;;;; "dylan/" is a prefix used for variables used in the expanded code
;;;;          generated by our Dylan->Lisp compiler.  All such functions
;;;;          are expecting to be called using Dylan calling syntax
;;;;          (i.e. they take both a multiple-value and a next-method
